  "title": "ISic000285. I.Sicily inscription 000285",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Curatores\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Curator\">Cura<span class=\"underline\">tores</span></span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Quintus\"><span data-text=\"Quintus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Quintus\">Q(uintus)</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Maculnius\"><span data-text=\"Maculnius\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Maculnius\">Mac<span class=\"underline\">ulnius</span></span></span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Titus\"><span data-text=\"Titus\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Titus\">Ṭ(itus)</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Truttedius\"><span data-text=\"Truttedius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Truttedius\">Trụt<span class=\"underline\">tedi</span>[us</span></span>  <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al4-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Aulus\"><span data-text=\"Aulus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">A(ulus)</span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Turius\"><span data-text=\"Turius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Turius\">Turiu<span class=\"underline\">s</span></span></span>  <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Auli\"><span data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\"><span class=\"underline\">A</span>(uli)</span></span> OCHAC[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive-simple-lemmatized\">  <div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <span data-text=\"Curatores\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Curator\">Curatores</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"Quintus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Quintus\">Quintus</span>  <span data-text=\"Maculnius\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Maculnius\">Maculnius</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"Titus\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Titus\">Titus</span>  <span data-text=\"Truttedius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Truttedius\">Truttedius</span> [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <span data-text=\"Aulus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">Aulus</span>  <span data-text=\"Turius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Turius\">Turius</span>  <span data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">Auli</span> OCHAC [<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Alex Antoniou, Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-text=\"Curatores\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Curator\">CURA<span class=\"underline\">TORES</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Quintus\"><span data-text=\"Quintus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Quintus\">Q</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Maculnius\"><span data-text=\"Maculnius\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Maculnius\">MAC<span class=\"underline\">ULNIUS</span></span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Titus\"><span data-text=\"Titus\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Titus\">.</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Truttedius\"><span data-text=\"Truttedius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Truttedius\">TR.T<span class=\"underline\">TEDI</span>[..</span></span><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al4-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">4</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Aulus\"><span data-text=\"Aulus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">A</span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Turius\"><span data-text=\"Turius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Turius\">TURIU<span class=\"underline\">S</span></span></span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Auli\"><span data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\"><span class=\"underline\">A</span></span></span>OCHAC[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Robert Crellin</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic-simple-lemmatized\"><div class=\"textpart\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><span data-text=\"Curatores\" data-n=\"5\" data-lemma=\"Curator\">CURATORES</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"Quintus\" data-n=\"15\" data-lemma=\"Quintus\">QUINTUS</span><span data-text=\"Maculnius\" data-n=\"20\" data-lemma=\"Maculnius\">MACULNIUS</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"Titus\" data-n=\"30\" data-lemma=\"Titus\">TITUS</span><span data-text=\"Truttedius\" data-n=\"35\" data-lemma=\"Truttedius\">TRUTTEDIUS</span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<span data-text=\"Aulus\" data-n=\"45\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">AULUS</span><span data-text=\"Turius\" data-n=\"50\" data-lemma=\"Turius\">TURIUS</span><span data-text=\"Auli\" data-n=\"55\" data-lemma=\"Aulus\">AULI</span>OCHAC[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000285_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo Liceo Lazzaro 2017-11-18\" src=\"ISic000285_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000285.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo Liceo Lazzaro 2017-11-18\" src=\"ISic000285-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span>  <span>Text of Korhonen 2004</span>  </span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7077-0703\">Alex Antoniou</a></p>  <p>Curators Quintus Maculnius, Titus Truttedius, Aulus Turius, son of Aulus</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>Only the left half of the text is preserved, compared to the earlier antiquarian records. The reading is extremely difficult, due to the nature of the volcanic stone, as noted already by Gualtherus. Modern repainting of the letters, seemingly following the reading of Gualtherus' second edition, only confuses the issue, rather than providing certainty (e.g. the painting of an A in line 3 appears to be without foundation on the stone). The text would appear to be of early (i.e. Augustan) date, reflecting construction of the aqueduct around the foundation of the Roman colonia.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li> Gualtherus 1624 273 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002388</a>  </li><li> Gualtherus 1624 [1625] <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/310975\" target=\"_blank\">335</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001931</a>  </li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/650753\" target=\"_blank\">6999</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a>  </li><li> Lagona 1964 84-85 tav.25.3 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001437\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001437</a>  </li><li> Coarelli and Torelli 1984 334 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002073\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002073</a>  </li><li> Manganaro 1988 44 n.216 tav.14 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001427</a>  </li><li> Belvedere 1988 378 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001429\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001429</a>  </li><li> Wilson 1988 125 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001430\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001430</a>  </li><li> Wilson 1990 98, 370 n.256 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001509</a>  </li><li> Korhonen 2004 25 <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000028</a>  </li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
